caption: Identity
engine-rule: identity

Atavistic is the Super Tradition Engine for progressively embodying one fixed Source. A Source may be one creature, species, lineage, animal model, monster stock, engineered ancestry, construct body, supernatural form, or another comparably objective intrinsic identity. The defining structure is a Fixed Source, a Closed Intrinsic Trait Universe, and Embodiment. Atavistic grants access to traits because they are properties of what the practitioner is becoming, not because they share a broad conceptual theme.
